/strong>\u00a0(FPS)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline loot based on KPM (kills per min) with no cap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud and local saves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Super Banjo Mode</strong> for a strategic damage/hp boost if you want to be more active!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/f7dc88926b92b4678eda5f4eefba0294.poster.avif?t=1750441907\" width=448 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/f7dc88926b92b4678eda5f4eefba0294.webm?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/f7dc88926b92b4678eda5f4eefba0294.mp4?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Crystals</strong> and use them to pull <strong>Cards</strong>. There are <strong>6</strong> card rarities with the most rare being <strong>Unique</strong> cards that provide powerful special bonuses. Each card has a chance of rolling 2 or 3x a stat. Purrfect your set and equip up to 10 cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/54117846a64267d13944f114c1b0d1d9.poster.avif?t=1750441907\" width=318 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/54117846a64267d13944f114c1b0d1d9.webm?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/54117846a64267d13944f114c1b0d1d9.mp4?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm <strong>Crystals</strong> and randomly create <strong>skills</strong>. Equip up to <strong>4</strong> skills of varying rarities.\u00a0 There are no set skills so it's entirely up to you which ones you equip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/6e2d3e2300d896296eef81ecb48c67dd.avif?t=1750441907\" width=352 height=612 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a DPS meter so you can tell which skills are performing and what your highest source of damage is. These are logged to files so external DPS meters can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/c37e5877e073054e5ff4ff1ad90508bd.poster.avif?t=1750441907\" width=450 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/c37e5877e073054e5ff4ff1ad90508bd.webm?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/c37e5877e073054e5ff4ff1ad90508bd.mp4?t=1750441907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Mew Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your basic skill starts humble but as you defeat enemies collect <strong>orbs</strong> you can upgrade\u00a0<strong>The Mew Sound </strong>and<strong>\u00a0</strong>become the next <strong>Meowsiah!</strong>\u00a0Apply <strong>orbs</strong> of differing rarities to upgrade your basic skill. The rarest orbs provide powerful buffs at a trade off. This system can be expanded in the future to apply all sorts of random effects and curve RNG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/7a6a5616fc86b7ac172e953d5967b5ec.avif?t=1750441907\" width=298 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigame</strong>\u00a0<strong>- Banjo Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames where you score is converted into currency for the main game. This game features a fully functional <strong>rhythm</strong>\u00a0minigame with a choice of <strong>17</strong> songs and varying difficulty levels. Match the notes with the keys!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/6a1aeba17dd780e9100e1c4cbf4b02b4.avif?t=1750441907\" width=318 height=366 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigame</strong>\u00a0<strong>- Grand Theft Meowto</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the streets in your home city in this fully functional FPS with drivable cars and displaceable objects. There are many tasks in this city such as he cardboard cut-out challenge, street racing and more! Convert your score into currency.<strong></strong><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527030/extras/6f6c25754800a0c31c49e3bbe4377620.avif?t=1750441907\" width=712 height=506 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Future?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The limits of Mister Gato are endless, I can place him in any style of minigame and the core idle game have massive room for expansion. How far it goes really depends on your feedback and input!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
